  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bigos is built in layers: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sauerkraut",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "sauerkraut-bigos"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " and fresh cabbage form the body, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dried mushrooms",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "porcini"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " add depth, and the mixed meats give richness. It simmers low and slow for hours. Serves 6."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The longer and more often you reheat it, the better it gets. Many Polish cooks consider it inedible on day one."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
